Dialogue: 8,0:15:39.96,0:15:42.17,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}えっと… えっと…
Dialogue: 9,0:15:42.17,0:15:44.57,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}望月 交給我吧
Dialogue: 8,0:15:42.17,0:15:44.57,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}望月さん 俺に任せて
