Dialogue: 8,0:15:55.59,0:15:57.36,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}I'm here from Australia
Dialogue: 9,0:15:57.36,0:16:01.65,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}我弟弟想讓我幫他帶一些日本人氣角色的周邊
