Dialogue: 8,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.14,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Excuse me. What's the matter?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.39,0:16:34.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}是這樣的 你看…
Dialogue: 8,0:16:33.39,0:16:34.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Yeah, you see...
