Dialogue: 8,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.27,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}I'm on holiday from Australia
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.27,0:16:41.06,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}我弟弟就讓我幫他帶一些在日本最有人氣的角色的周邊回去
