Dialogue: 8,0:16:45.15,0:16:49.66,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}I think you'll definitely find something! There are just so many characters to choose from.
