Dialogue: 8,0:16:47.98,0:16:49.66,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,93)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}助かった…
Dialogue: 9,0:16:49.95,0:16:52.31,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}好厲害～莉莉在說英語
Dialogue: 8,0:16:49.95,0:16:52.31,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}すげ～ 英語しゃべってる
