Dialogue: 9,0:17:30.85,0:17:33.70,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}原來如此…{\fscx50} {\fscx100}角色周邊啊
Dialogue: 8,0:17:30.85,0:17:33.70,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}なるほど… キャラクターグッズか
Dialogue: 9,0:17:33.70,0:17:34.83,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}那肯定是…
Dialogue: 8,0:17:33.70,0:17:34.83,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}だったら…
Dialogue: 9,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.83,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}肯定是格鬥遊戲的角色啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.83,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}格ゲーのキャラに決まってるだろ！
