Dialogue: 9,0:17:42.10,0:17:45.55,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}對吧？咱可是把命都賭在格鬥遊戲上了
Dialogue: 8,0:17:42.10,0:17:45.55,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}だろ？ ウチはこいつに 命賭けてんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.86,0:17:48.19,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}好！小哥 跟我比一場吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:45.86,0:17:48.19,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}よし！ 兄さん ウチと勝負だ！
Dialogue: 9,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.05,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}我在打工！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.05,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}だからバイト中！
Dialogue: 9,0:17:50.85,0:17:53.29,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}要說現在流行的人氣角色
Dialogue: 8,0:17:50.85,0:17:53.29,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}今 はやってる人気キャラといえば
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.14,0:17:55.50,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}是勁舞對吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:54.14,0:17:55.50,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ナイダンでしょ！
Dialogue: 9,0:17:56.07,0:17:58.86,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}明明說是給兒童玩的遊戲
Dialogue: 8,0:17:56.07,0:17:58.86,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}子ども向けのゲームだって 言ってたのに
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.15,0:18:03.14,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}昨天看到莉莉在玩 感覺挺有趣的
Dialogue: 8,0:17:59.15,0:18:03.14,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}昨日 リリーちゃんが やってるの見てたら 興味湧いちゃってさ
Dialogue: 9,0:18:03.38,0:18:04.40,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}但是…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:03.38,0:18:04.40,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}でも…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.57,0:18:07.94,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}人這麼多的話有點…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:05.57,0:18:07.94,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}こんなにメチャ混みじゃあな
Dialogue: 9,0:18:10.13,0:18:13.32,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}我強烈推薦問答遊戲
Dialogue: 8,0:18:10.13,0:18:13.32,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}私は断然 クイズゲームをオススメいたします
Dialogue: 9,0:18:13.71,0:18:18.46,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}不僅需要智力 還講究團隊合作和反應神經
Dialogue: 8,0:18:13.71,0:18:18.46,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}知力だけでなく チームプレイや反射神経も要求される
Dialogue: 9,0:18:18.46,0:18:20.53,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}這才是終極遊戲！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:18.46,0:18:20.53,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}これぞ究極のゲームです！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:20.83,0:18:21.83,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}噢！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:20.83,0:18:21.83,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}oh...!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.03,0:18:26.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}終極是終極 但問答遊戲是日語 她看不懂吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:22.03,0:18:26.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}究極はいいけど クイズゲームって日本語だから わからないんじゃない？
Dialogue: 9,0:18:27.35,0:18:29.60,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}而且這已經不是在說角色了
Dialogue: 8,0:18:27.35,0:18:29.60,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}もはや キャラクターの話じゃないし
Dialogue: 9,0:18:31.12,0:18:32.59,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}既然如此！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:31.12,0:18:32.59,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}こうなったら！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:35.55,0:18:37.60,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}只能是男子氣概無尾熊了吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:35.55,0:18:37.60,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}漢気コアラ オンリーよね！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.06,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}果然…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.06,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}やっぱり…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.68,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}好可愛！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.68,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Lovely!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:40.68,0:18:41.48,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}欸欸！？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:40.68,0:18:41.48,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ええっ！？
Dialogue: 9,0:18:41.92,0:18:46.10,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}喬迪是澳洲人 所以對無尾熊有親近感不是嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:41.92,0:18:46.10,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ジョディさん オーストラリア人だから コアラは なじみがあるんじゃない？
Dialogue: 9,0:18:46.43,0:18:48.73,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}原 原來如此
Dialogue: 8,0:18:46.43,0:18:48.73,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}な… なるほど
Dialogue: 9,0:18:50.45,0:18:54.61,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}莉莉 難道你是預想到這一點才推薦男子氣概無尾熊的…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:50.45,0:18:54.61,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}リリーちゃん もしかして それを見越して 漢気コアラを…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.91,0:19:00.12,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}當無尾熊先生戴上墨鏡的時候 它的男子氣概模式就會啟動！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:54.91,0:19:00.12,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}And when this Mr. Koala wears sunglasses, then his otokogi mode starts!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.60,0:19:03.76,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}不 應該不是吧…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:01.60,0:19:03.76,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}いヤ それはないか…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.09,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}嗯嗯…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.09,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}うんうん…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:07.59,0:19:09.96,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}你真的很喜歡這個角色呢
Dialogue: 8,0:19:07.59,0:19:09.96,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}You really like this character, huh.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.55,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}是的！我太愛了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.55,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Yup! I adore him!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:14.48,0:19:16.39,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}那我就選它吧
Dialogue: 8,0:19:14.48,0:19:16.39,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Then I think he'll do.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:17.29,0:19:19.93,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}但我想不到該怎麼把它拿到手
Dialogue: 8,0:19:17.29,0:19:19.93,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}I really have no idea how to get him, though.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:22.13,0:19:23.21,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}那就交給我吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:22.13,0:19:23.21,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:28.40,0:19:31.57,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}說實話 我完全挪不動它一點啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:28.40,0:19:31.57,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Honestly, I just can't seem to move him!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:31.86,0:19:34.49,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}喬蒂 非常抱歉！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:31.86,0:19:34.49,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Jody, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:34.90,0:19:37.03,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}好吧 看起來是挺難的…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:34.90,0:19:37.03,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Well, it does seem hard...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.32,0:19:38.91,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}我會繼續嘗試的！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:37.32,0:19:38.91,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}I'll keep trying!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:39.07,0:19:39.82,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}唉…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:39.07,0:19:39.82,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ハァ…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:40.25,0:19:42.55,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}真是看不下去了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:40.25,0:19:42.55,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ったく 見てらんねえな
Dialogue: 9,0:19:42.55,0:19:44.62,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}我們也來幫忙吧
Dialogue: 8,0:19:42.55,0:19:44.62,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}私たちも手伝おうか
Dialogue: 9,0:19:48.05,0:19:51.62,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}玩偶堆成這樣的話 也許後面的比較好抓
Dialogue: 8,0:19:48.05,0:19:51.62,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}この配置だと 後ろ側を狙ったほうがいいかも
Dialogue: 9,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.62,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}啊 對啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.62,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あっ そうか！
Dialogue: 9,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.93,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}那樣的話 那邊那個應該不錯
Dialogue: 8,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.93,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}だったら あのぬいぐるみがいいよね
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.93,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}對 就以那個為目標
Dialogue: 8,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.93,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}そうそう アイツが狙い目だな
Dialogue: 9,0:20:09.10,0:20:10.69,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}抓到啦～！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:09.10,0:20:10.69,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}取れた～っ！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:10.94,0:20:12.53,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}太好了呢 莉莉！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:10.94,0:20:12.53,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}やったね リリーちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.86,0:20:14.19,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}總算抓到了啊
Dialogue: 8,0:20:12.86,0:20:14.19,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ようやくかよ
Dialogue: 9,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.14,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}真厲害
Dialogue: 8,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.14,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}さすがです
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.14,0:20:19.95,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}讓我學到了 不放棄的精神很重要
Dialogue: 8,0:20:16.14,0:20:19.95,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}諦めない気持ちが大事だと 学ばさせていただきました
Dialogue: 9,0:20:20.46,0:20:21.01,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}給
Dialogue: 8,0:20:20.46,0:20:21.01,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}はい！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.91,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}謝謝你！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.91,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Thank you!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:26.96,0:20:28.96,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}你對他有意思 是吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:26.96,0:20:28.96,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}You fancy him, don't you?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:29.75,0:20:33.92,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}呃 什麼？呃…
Dialogue: 8,0:20:29.75,0:20:33.92,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Wh-What? Um...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:34.51,0:20:36.72,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}如果你想的話 我可以給你個小建議
Dialogue: 8,0:20:34.51,0:20:36.72,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}I can give you advice, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:37.63,0:20:38.97,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}真 真的嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:37.63,0:20:38.97,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}R-Really?!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.26,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,30)}當然啦
Dialogue: 8,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.26,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,93)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.85,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,30)}那你最近都做了什麼和他加深關係的事呢
Dialogue: 8,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.85,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,93)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}What have you been doing lately to get closer to him?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:42.85,0:20:44.58,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,30)}我有在給他寫親筆信
Dialogue: 8,0:20:42.85,0:20:44.58,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,93)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}I've been writing him letters.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.53,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}她們在說什麼呢？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.53,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}なんの話をしてるんだろ？
Dialogue: 9,0:20:44.05,0:20:47.44,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}我也必須更加努力學習英語了
Dialogue: 8,0:20:44.05,0:20:47.44,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}私も もっと 英語の勉強をしなくては
Dialogue: 9,0:20:52.19,0:20:55.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}在遊戲中心 沒準真會有一場奇遇
Dialogue: 8,0:20:52.19,0:20:55.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ゲームセンターは 出会いの場所でも あるようです
Dialogue: 9,0:20:59.25,0:21:02.02,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}這到底是怎麼回事！？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:59.25,0:21:02.02,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}これはいったい どういうことだ！？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.72,0:21:06.54,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}歡迎光臨…
Dialogue: 8,0:21:04.72,0:21:06.54,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あっ いらっしゃいませ…
Dialogue: 9,0:21:08.10,0:21:10.43,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}我偶然間發現
Dialogue: 8,0:21:08.10,0:21:10.43,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}リリーの部屋に 飾って あるのを
Dialogue: 9,0:21:10.43,0:21:12.98,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}莉莉房間裡掛著這個東西
